Spec: Windows visitor access verification

Purpose:
  Verify exact local permission is independent of reviewed declarations and remote publisher grants.

Owns:
  ./LocalAccessTests.cs

Must:
  Remove newer connection journals when constructing older schema fixtures; migration must not invent flows or attachments.
  Use owned private databases and locally issued identities, without cloud, service installation or route changes.
  Cover absent/wrong caller and scope, stale proposals, retained-operation conflicts, denial preservation, reapproval and peer invalidation, rollback and restart.
  Prove full-budget revocation consumes its reservation and schema-six migration invents no access; missing current-schema tables fail closed.
